# main-tema-cathode-agua: the Cathode theme on the waterfall-in-movement state
# of main-espectro-agua (peaks on, the centre line drawn, spectrum filled). It is
# the same radio state as that fixture with the theme as the only variable, so
# the waterfall carries Cathode's own 256-colour table (theme.c make_palette over
# the JSON `waterfall` stops: black -> espresso -> burnt umber -> copper -> amber
# -> parchment cream) and the band plan / spectrum are read against it.

name main-tema-cathode-agua
screen main

theme Cathode
seed 7
spectrum_peak true
waterfall_center_line true
spectrum_filled true

frequency_hz 14074000
tx_frequency_hz 14074000
fft_width_hz 384000

mode usb
vfo A
agc auto

split false
att false
pre false
atu false
ant 1

smeter_db -90

battery_v 12.3
external_v 13.8
battery_cap 84
charging false

rxtx rx
